1
00:00:07,757 --> 00:00:09,050
Are we sure this is alright?

2
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:10,218
God, we're screwed.

3
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:11,845
So Tae Hun is
the team captain now?

4
00:00:13,179 --> 00:00:14,723
I can't feel my hands anymore

5
00:00:15,015 --> 00:00:16,015
This is bad.

6
00:00:27,736 --> 00:00:28,736
Yes!

7
00:00:28,987 --> 00:00:29,987
Yes, he did it!

8
00:00:30,196 --> 00:00:32,991
Of course, he is just
a high school kid after all.

9
00:00:32,991 --> 00:00:34,991
He can't throw ten balls
in the same spot in a row.

10
00:00:35,535 --> 00:00:36,119
What?

11
00:00:36,494 --> 00:00:38,079
His expression was weird.

12
00:00:38,288 --> 00:00:40,608
No way I would have caught it
if it'd been thrown properly.

13
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:47,422
Damn it!

14
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:54,303
Accept your defeat.

15
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:55,472
I won't.

16
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:56,680
What?

17
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:58,892
You promised to participate
in our team training!

18
00:00:59,309 --> 00:01:00,935
My throw was perfect.

19
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:03,250
It was just that the ball
was damaged.

20
00:01:04,272 --> 00:01:05,982
So what?

21
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:08,085
Don't you realize damages like
that is nothing in baseball?

22
00:01:08,109 --> 00:01:09,109
I told you.

23
00:01:09,194 --> 00:01:10,445
My throw was flawless.

24
00:01:11,738 --> 00:01:12,738
Snap out of it.

25
00:01:14,324 --> 00:01:15,533
If the ball was weird

26
00:01:15,825 --> 00:01:17,327
then you should have
said something.

27
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,953
You think excuses like this
will work during a game?
